{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"FX Macrodata API","description":"Official-source macroeconomic indicators, release calendars, central-bank policy rates, FX reference rates, COT positioning and commodities across 22 currencies. USD data is available without an API key; other currencies and datasets need an `X-API-Key` header.","version":"1.0.0"},"paths":{"/v1/health":{"get":{"tags":["health"],"summary":"Ping the API","description":"Returns a simple OK status to verify the API is running.","operationId":"ping_v1_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Health-check response confirming API availability.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ServiceStatusResponse"},"example":{"status":"ok","service":"fxmacrodata-api"}}}}}}},"/v1/ping":{"get":{"tags":["health"],"summary":"Ping the API","description":"Returns a simple OK status to verify the API is running.","operationId":"ping_v1_ping_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Health-check response confirming API availability.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ServiceStatusResponse"},"example":{"status":"ok","service":"fxmacrodata-api"}}}}}}},"/v1/forex/{base}/{quote}":{"get":{"tags":["fx_markets"],"summary":"Get FX spot rates","description":"Fetches daily FX spot rates between two currencies using official central-bank reference rates.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `base`: Base currency code (e.g., AUD, USD).\n- `quote`: Quote currency code (e.g., USD, EUR).\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n- `start_date`: Optional. Start date YYYY-MM-DD. Defaults to 365 days ago.\n- `end_date`: Optional. End date YYYY-MM-DD. Defaults to today.\n\n- `indicators`: Optional. Comma-separated list of technical indicators to compute from the spot-rate series and include in the response. Pass `all` to include every supported indicator. Supported values: `adx_14`, `atr_14`, `bollinger_bands`, `cci_20`, `donchian_20`, `ema_12`, `ema_20`, `ema_200`, `ema_26`, `ema_50`, `macd`, `macd_histogram`, `macd_signal`, `rsi_14`, `sma_20`, `sma_200`, `sma_50`, `stochastic_14_3`, `williams_r_14`, `all`.\n\n**Daily reference OHLC:**\n- On qualifying dates, `data[]` also includes `open`, `high`, `low`, and `close` built from timestamped eligible reference observations. These are `reference_observation_ohlc` bars, not executable-market candles. Rows without at least four observations omit the OHLC fields.\n\n**FX source and derivation metadata:**\n- FX values are official reference rates collected by FXMacroData. USD-quoted pairs are the base series; inverse and cross pairs are derived from those legs when the publisher does not provide the requested pair directly.\n- Responses include `pair_metadata` and row-level `data[].source` with `direct_available`, `inverse_available`, `is_derived`, `derived_from_inverse`, `derived_from_cross`, `derived_from_source_legs`, `derivation_method`, `anchor_currency`, `source_pair`, `source_legs`, and `pair_consistency_check`.\n- Upstream FX source priority is BIS XRU daily USD exchange rates where available, then official national-bank daily sources, explicitly labelled EUR/CAD-derived daily crosses, official USD pegs, BIS monthly averages expanded to business days, IMF IFS monthly rates, and World Bank annual rates. Lower-frequency expansions are labelled with `source_frequency` and `derivation_method`; they are not presented as true daily fixings.\n- `data[].observation_datetime` is the UTC midnight timestamp for the FX reference date. It is an observation-date marker, not a publication timestamp.\n- XAU/USD and USD/XAU use the stored gold series: the National Bank of Ukraine official accounting price of gold divided by the NBU official UAH/USD rate for the same official rate date (Narodowy Bank Polski gold only for dates the NBU did not supply). Source: National Bank of Ukraine (https://bank.gov.ua/en/open-data). No publication clock or LBMA auction price is asserted. Weekday-label coverage is included.","operationId":"forex_v1_forex__base___quote__get","parameters":[{"name":"base","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Base currency code","examples":["AUD"],"title":"Base","enum":["AUD","BRL","CAD","CHF","CNH","CNY","DKK","EUR","GBP","HUF","ILS","JPY","KRW","MYR","NGN","NOK","NZD","PEN","SEK","THB","TWD","USD"],"example":"AUD"},"description":"Required path parameter. Base currency code Allowed values: AUD, BRL, CAD, CHF, CNH, CNY, DKK, EUR, GBP, HUF, ILS, JPY, KRW, MYR, NGN, NOK, NZD, PEN, SEK, THB, TWD, USD."},{"name":"quote","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Quote currency code","examples":["USD"],"title":"Quote","enum":["AUD","BRL","CAD","CHF","CNH","CNY","DKK","EUR","GBP","HUF","ILS","JPY","KRW","MYR","NGN","NOK","NZD","PEN","SEK","THB","TWD","USD"],"example":"AUD"},"description":"Required path parameter. Quote currency code Allowed values: AUD, BRL, CAD, CHF, CNH, CNY, DKK, EUR, GBP, HUF, ILS, JPY, KRW, MYR, NGN, NOK, NZD, PEN, SEK, THB, TWD, USD."},{"name":"start_date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Start date YYYY-MM-DD","examples":["2026-01-01"],"title":"Start Date"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Start date YYYY-MM-DD"},{"name":"end_date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"End date YYYY-MM-DD","examples":["2026-03-01"],"title":"End Date"},"description":"Optional query parameter. End date YYYY-MM-DD"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"description":"Maximum rows to return. Defaults to 20. Maximum 100.","examples":[20],"default":20,"title":"Limit"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Maximum rows to return. Defaults to 20. Maximum 100."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"Number of rows to skip after most-recent-first ordering.","examples":[0],"default":0,"title":"Offset"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Number of rows to skip after most-recent-first ordering."},{"name":"page","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer","minimum":1},{"type":"null"}],"description":"One-based page number. When supplied, it takes precedence over offset.","examples":[1],"title":"Page"},"description":"Optional query parameter. One-based page number. When supplied, it takes precedence over offset."},{"name":"indicators","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Comma-separated technical indicators to compute (e.g. sma_20,rsi_14,macd,bollinger_bands). Use 'all' to request every supported indicator.","examples":["sma_20,rsi_14,macd"],"title":"Indicators"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Comma-separated technical indicators to compute (e.g. sma_20,rsi_14,macd,bollinger_bands). Use 'all' to request every supported indicator."},{"name":"dataset_version","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Pin the content version returned by the first page; changed history returns 409.","title":"Dataset Version"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Pin the content version returned by the first page; changed history returns 409."},{"name":"api_key","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Your Individual or Business API key","title":"Api Key"},"description":"Deprecated: legacy query-string API key. Still accepted so existing integrations keep working, but new integrations must send the key in the X-API-Key header (or Authorization: Bearer). A key is required for non-USD, paid-only, or full-history requests. Responses to requests authenticated this way carry a Deprecation header.","deprecated":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Daily FX spot-rate series with optional computed technical indicators.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ForexResponse"},"example":{"base":"USD","quote":"JPY","source":"Official central-bank reference rates","provenance":{"publisher":"Official central-bank reference rates","storage":"FXMacroData","timestamp_field":"date","value_field":"val"},"pair_metadata":{"direct_available":true,"inverse_available":false,"derived_from_inverse":false,"derived_from_cross":false,"derived_from_source_legs":false,"is_derived":false,"derivation_method":"direct_original_pair","source_pair":"USD/JPY","source_legs":[{"pair":"USD/JPY","source_provider":"BIS XRU","source_name":"BIS XRU daily USD exchange rates","source_url":"https://stats.bis.org/api/v2/data/dataflow/BIS/WS_XRU/1.0","source_frequency":"daily"}],"pair_consistency_check":"passed"},"data_quality":{"source_name":"Official central-bank reference rates","source_type":"official","is_derived":false,"datetime_field":"observation_datetime","datetime_precision":"date","source_legs":[{"pair":"USD/JPY","source_provider":"BIS XRU","source_frequency":"daily"}]},"start_date":"2026-06-17","end_date":"2026-06-18","data":[{"date":"2026-06-18","val":161.1288,"observation_datetime":1781740800,"observation_datetime_iso":"2026-06-18T00:00:00Z","observation_datetime_precision":"date","source":{"source_pair":"USD/JPY","source_legs":[{"pair":"USD/JPY","source_provider":"BIS XRU","source_frequency":"daily"}],"is_derived":false,"derivation_method":"direct_original_pair","pair_consistency_check":"passed"}},{"date":"2026-06-17","val":161.1288,"observation_datetime":1781654400,"observation_datetime_iso":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","observation_datetime_precision":"date","source":{"source_pair":"USD/JPY","source_legs":[{"pair":"USD/JPY","source_provider":"BIS XRU","source_frequency":"daily"}],"is_derived":false,"derivation_method":"direct_original_pair","pair_consistency_check":"passed"}}],"indicators":{"sma_20":0.6519,"rsi_14":58.42,"macd":{"macd":0.0012,"signal":0.0009,"histogram":0.0003}}}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"x-parameter-availability":{"base":["AUD","BRL","CAD","CHF","CNH","CNY","DKK","EUR","GBP","HUF","ILS","JPY","KRW","MYR","NGN","NOK","NZD","PEN","SEK","THB","TWD","USD"],"quote":["AUD","BRL","CAD","CHF","CNH","CNY","DKK","EUR","GBP","HUF","ILS","JPY","KRW","MYR","NGN","NOK","NZD","PEN","SEK","THB","TWD","USD"],"indicators":["adx_14","atr_14","bollinger_bands","cci_20","donchian_20","ema_12","ema_20","ema_200","ema_26","ema_50","macd","macd_histogram","macd_signal","rsi_14","sma_20","sma_200","sma_50","stochastic_14_3","williams_r_14","all"]}}},"/v1/fx/reference-rates/{base}/{quote}":{"get":{"tags":["fx_markets"],"summary":"Get timestamped official FX reference rates","operationId":"reference_rates_v1_fx_reference_rates__base___quote__get","parameters":[{"name":"base","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Base currency code","examples":["EUR"],"title":"Base"},"description":"Required path parameter. Base currency code"},{"name":"quote","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Quote currency code","examples":["USD"],"title":"Quote"},"description":"Required path parameter. Quote currency code"},{"name":"date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Single reference date YYYY-MM-DD. Overrides start_date/end_date.","examples":["2026-07-10"],"title":"Date"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Single reference date YYYY-MM-DD. Overrides start_date/end_date."},{"name":"start_date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Start reference date YYYY-MM-DD.","examples":["2026-07-10"],"title":"Start Date"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Start reference date YYYY-MM-DD."},{"name":"end_date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"End reference date YYYY-MM-DD.","examples":["2026-07-10"],"title":"End Date"},"description":"Optional query parameter. End reference date YYYY-MM-DD."},{"name":"source","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Optional source id filter, for example ecb_eurofxref_daily.","title":"Source"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Optional source id filter, for example ecb_eurofxref_daily."},{"name":"timestamp_type","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Optional timestamp type filter, for example fixing or published.","title":"Timestamp Type"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Optional timestamp type filter, for example fixing or published."},{"name":"native_only","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"Return only rows published directly for the requested pair, excluding inverse and cross-derived rows.","default":false,"title":"Native Only"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Return only rows published directly for the requested pair, excluding inverse and cross-derived rows."},{"name":"include_source_legs","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"Include derivation source legs when a rate is inverted or crossed.","default":true,"title":"Include Source Legs"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Include derivation source legs when a rate is inverted or crossed."},{"name":"order","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"enum":["timestamp_asc","timestamp_desc","date_asc","date_desc"],"type":"string","description":"Result ordering.","default":"timestamp_asc","title":"Order"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Result ordering."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"description":"Maximum rows to return. Maximum 100.","default":100,"title":"Limit"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Maximum rows to return. Maximum 100."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"Number of rows to skip.","default":0,"title":"Offset"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Number of rows to skip."},{"name":"page","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer","minimum":1},{"type":"null"}],"description":"One-based page number.","title":"Page"},"description":"Optional query parameter. One-based page number."},{"name":"dataset_version","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Pin first-page content version; changed history returns 409.","title":"Dataset Version"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Pin first-page content version; changed history returns 409."},{"name":"api_key","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Your Individual or Business API key","title":"Api Key"},"description":"Deprecated: legacy query-string API key. Still accepted so existing integrations keep working, but new integrations must send the key in the X-API-Key header (or Authorization: Bearer). A key is required for non-USD, paid-only, or full-history requests. Responses to requests authenticated this way carry a Deprecation header.","deprecated":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FxReferenceResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/v1/fx/intraday-reference-rates/{base}/{quote}":{"get":{"tags":["fx_markets"],"summary":"Get subscriber intraday FX reference rates","description":"Return subscriber-only timestamped intraday FX reference rates.","operationId":"intraday_reference_rates_v1_fx_intraday_reference_rates__base___quote__get","parameters":[{"name":"base","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Base currency code","examples":["EUR"],"title":"Base"},"description":"Required path parameter. Base currency code"},{"name":"quote","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Quote currency code","examples":["USD"],"title":"Quote"},"description":"Required path parameter. Quote currency code"},{"name":"start_time","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Inclusive RFC 3339 timestamp. Defaults to 24 hours before end_time.","examples":["2026-07-13T00:00:00Z"],"title":"Start Time"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Inclusive RFC 3339 timestamp. Defaults to 24 hours before end_time."},{"name":"end_time","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Inclusive RFC 3339 source timestamp. Defaults to the current time.","examples":["2026-07-14T00:00:00Z"],"title":"End Time"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Inclusive RFC 3339 source timestamp. Defaults to the current time."},{"name":"api_key","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Your Individual or Business API key","title":"Api Key"},"description":"Deprecated: legacy query-string API key. Still accepted so existing integrations keep working, but new integrations must send the key in the X-API-Key header (or Authorization: Bearer). A key is required for non-USD, paid-only, or full-history requests. Responses to requests authenticated this way carry a Deprecation header.","deprecated":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FxIntradayReferenceRatesResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/v1/fx/session-rates/{base}/{quote}":{"get":{"tags":["fx_markets"],"summary":"Get official FX session-close reference rates","operationId":"session_rates_v1_fx_session_rates__base___quote__get","parameters":[{"name":"base","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Base currency code","examples":["EUR"],"title":"Base"},"description":"Required path parameter. Base currency code"},{"name":"quote","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Quote currency code","examples":["USD"],"title":"Quote"},"description":"Required path parameter. Quote currency code"},{"name":"session","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Session name: sydney, tokyo, london, or new_york.","examples":["london"],"title":"Session"},"description":"Required query parameter. Session name: sydney, tokyo, london, or new_york."},{"name":"date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Single reference date YYYY-MM-DD. Overrides start_date/end_date.","examples":["2026-07-10"],"title":"Date"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Single reference date YYYY-MM-DD. Overrides start_date/end_date."},{"name":"start_date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Start reference date YYYY-MM-DD.","title":"Start Date"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Start reference date YYYY-MM-DD."},{"name":"end_date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"End reference date YYYY-MM-DD.","title":"End Date"},"description":"Optional query parameter. End reference date YYYY-MM-DD."},{"name":"order","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"enum":["timestamp_asc","timestamp_desc","date_asc","date_desc"],"type":"string","description":"Result ordering.","default":"date_asc","title":"Order"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Result ordering."},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"description":"Maximum rows to return. Maximum 100.","default":100,"title":"Limit"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Maximum rows to return. Maximum 100."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"Number of rows to skip.","default":0,"title":"Offset"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Number of rows to skip."},{"name":"page","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer","minimum":1},{"type":"null"}],"description":"One-based page number.","title":"Page"},"description":"Optional query parameter. One-based page number."},{"name":"dataset_version","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Pin first-page content version; changed history returns 409.","title":"Dataset Version"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Pin first-page content version; changed history returns 409."},{"name":"api_key","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Your Individual or Business API key","title":"Api Key"},"description":"Deprecated: legacy query-string API key. Still accepted so existing integrations keep working, but new integrations must send the key in the X-API-Key header (or Authorization: Bearer). A key is required for non-USD, paid-only, or full-history requests. Responses to requests authenticated this way carry a Deprecation header.","deprecated":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FxSessionRateResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/v1/fx/sources":{"get":{"tags":["fx_markets"],"summary":"List public FX reference-rate sources","description":"Lists the official FX reference-rate sources and the pairs each one publishes. `native_pairs` documents what the authority publishes; only `served_pairs` are available from the public FX endpoints. Sources with `serves_public_data: false` (an empty `served_pairs`) are listed for provenance only and return no data. Use `/v1/fx/source-universe` for the requestable pair universe.","operationId":"fx_sources_v1_fx_sources_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FxSourcesResponse"}}}}}}},"/v1/fx/source-universe":{"get":{"tags":["fx_markets"],"summary":"List public FX reference-rate pair universe","operationId":"fx_source_universe_v1_fx_source_universe_get","parameters":[{"name":"currency","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Optional currency filter, for example USD.","examples":["USD"],"title":"Currency"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Optional currency filter, for example USD."},{"name":"source","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Optional source id filter, for example ecb_eurofxref_daily.","title":"Source"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Optional source id filter, for example ecb_eurofxref_daily."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FxSourceUniverseResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/v1/research/panel":{"post":{"tags":["announcements"],"summary":"Build a panel of values known at each decision time","operationId":"research_panel_v1_research_panel_post","parameters":[{"name":"api_key","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Your Individual or Business API key","title":"Api Key"},"description":"Deprecated: legacy query-string API key. Still accepted so existing integrations keep working, but new integrations must send the key in the X-API-Key header (or Authorization: Bearer). A key is required for non-USD, paid-only, or full-history requests. Responses to requests authenticated this way carry a Deprecation header.","deprecated":true}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResearchPanelRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ResearchPanelResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/v1/data_catalogue/{currency}":{"get":{"tags":["data_catalogue"],"summary":"Get Currently Available Macroeconomic Indicators","description":"Returns the currently available macroeconomic indicators for a specific currency.\n\n    Availability reflects the data currently served, so temporarily\n    unavailable series are excluded until data is available again. The\n    catalogue is refreshed on a regular schedule.\n\n    This endpoint also replaces the deprecated `/v1/capabilities` and\n    `/v1/coverage_matrix` endpoints. Coverage is included directly on each\n    catalogue entry. To also include the legacy top-level coverage list, call it\n    with `include_coverage=true`. To include capability metadata, call it with\n    `include_capabilities=true`.\n\n    Each entry includes:\n    * **name**: The full descriptive name of the metric.\n    * **unit**: The unit of measurement (e.g., %YoY, Billions of USD).\n    * **frequency**: How often the data is updated (Daily, Monthly, Quarterly).\n    * **source** / **source_url**: The publisher or source family for the series, when available.\n    * **source_series_id** / **source_series_name**: The upstream source identifier and exact source-series label, when available.\n    * **seasonal_adjustment**: Seasonal basis (`SA`, `NSA`, `UNKNOWN`, or `NOT_APPLICABLE`).\n    * **price_basis**: GDP/level price basis (`REAL`, `NOMINAL`, or `UNKNOWN`) when applicable.\n    * **aliases** / **related_indicators**: Optional flat discovery metadata for common alternative names and adjacent indicators.\n    * **standardization_note**: Optional note explaining sign, unit, scope, or cross-currency comparability choices.\n    * **has_official_forecast**: Whether the relevant central bank or statistics agency publishes a preliminary, flash, or advance estimate of this indicator before the main/final data release.\n    * **coverage**: Earliest/latest available dates, row count, recency status, and coverage quality for that indicator.","operationId":"get_data_catalogue_v1_data_catalogue__currency__get","parameters":[{"name":"currency","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"The 3-letter currency code (e.g., USD, AUD, EUR, GBP, CHF)","examples":["USD"],"title":"Currency","enum":["AUD","BRL","CAD","CHF","CNH","CNY","DKK","EUR","GBP","HUF","ILS","JPY","KRW","MYR","NGN","NOK","NZD","PEN","SEK","THB","TWD","USD"],"example":"AUD"},"description":"Required path parameter. The 3-letter currency code (e.g., USD, AUD, EUR, GBP, CHF) Allowed values: AUD, BRL, CAD, CHF, CNH, CNY, DKK, EUR, GBP, HUF, ILS, JPY, KRW, MYR, NGN, NOK, NZD, PEN, SEK, THB, TWD, USD."},{"name":"include_capabilities","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"Include currency-scoped endpoint/auth metadata that replaces the deprecated /v1/capabilities response.","default":false,"title":"Include Capabilities"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Include currency-scoped endpoint/auth metadata that replaces the deprecated /v1/capabilities response."},{"name":"include_coverage","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"Also include the legacy currency-scoped coverage list that replaces the deprecated /v1/coverage_matrix response. Per-indicator coverage is included in catalogue entries by default.","default":false,"title":"Include Coverage"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Also include the legacy currency-scoped coverage list that replaces the deprecated /v1/coverage_matrix response. Per-indicator coverage is included in catalogue entries by default."},{"name":"indicator","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Optional indicator filter when include_coverage=true.","examples":["inflation"],"title":"Indicator","enum":["afe_dollar_index","average_hourly_earnings","average_hourly_earnings_mom","balance_on_goods","balance_on_services","bgcr","breakeven_inflation_rate","broad_dollar_index","broad_money","building_approvals","building_permits","business_confidence","capital_account_balance","cb_assets","commodity_price_energy","commodity_price_ex_energy","commodity_price_index","commodity_prices","consumer_confidence","core_inflation","core_inflation_median","core_inflation_mom","core_inflation_trim","core_pce","core_pce_mom","credit_growth","crude_oil_inventories","current_account_balance","dairy_exports","deposit_rates","durable_goods_orders","effr","eme_dollar_index","employment","exports","financial_account_balance","foreign_reserves","full_time_employment","fx_reserves","gdp","gdp_growth_q4_yoy","gold_reserves","gov_bond_10y","gov_bond_15y","gov_bond_1_5m","gov_bond_1m","gov_bond_1y","gov_bond_20y","gov_bond_25y","gov_bond_2m","gov_bond_2y","gov_bond_30y","gov_bond_3m","gov_bond_3y","gov_bond_40y","gov_bond_4m","gov_bond_4y","gov_bond_5y","gov_bond_6m","gov_bond_6y","gov_bond_7y","gov_bond_8y","gov_bond_9y","government_debt","house_price_index","house_prices","household_credit","household_spending","housing_starts","import_prices","imports","industrial_production","inflation","inflation_linked_bond","inflation_mom","initial_jobless_claims","international_assets","international_liabilities","job_openings","m1","m2","m3","nairu","natural_gas_storage","net_foreign_asset_position","non_farm_payrolls","non_farm_payrolls_change","obfr","part_time_employment","participation_rate","pce","pce_mom","policy_rate","policy_rate_midpoint","policy_rate_mlf","policy_rate_mro","policy_rate_target_lower","ppi","primary_income_balance","productivity","real_yield_20y","real_yield_30y","real_yield_5y","real_yield_7y","retail_sales","retail_sales_control_group","retail_sales_ex_autos","retail_sales_ex_autos_and_gas","risk_free_rate","secondary_income_balance","sight_deposits","snb_balance_sheet","sofr