,"ppi","trade_balance","unemployment"],"TWD":["employment","foreign_reserves","participation_rate","risk_free_rate","trade_weighted_index","unemployment"],"USD":["afe_dollar_index","average_hourly_earnings","average_hourly_earnings_mom","bgcr","breakeven_inflation_rate","broad_dollar_index","building_permits","business_confidence","cb_assets","consumer_confidence","core_inflation","core_inflation_mom","core_pce","core_pce_mom","crude_oil_inventories","current_account_balance","durable_goods_orders","effr","eme_dollar_index","employment","foreign_reserves","full_time_employment","gdp","gdp_growth_q4_yoy","gold_reserves","gov_bond_10y","gov_bond_1_5m","gov_bond_1m","gov_bond_1y","gov_bond_20y","gov_bond_2m","gov_bond_2y","gov_bond_30y","gov_bond_3m","gov_bond_3y","gov_bond_4m","gov_bond_5y","gov_bond_6m","gov_bond_7y","government_debt","house_price_index","housing_starts","import_prices","industrial_production","inflation","inflation_linked_bond","inflation_mom","initial_jobless_claims","job_openings","m1","m2","nairu","natural_gas_storage","non_farm_payrolls","non_farm_payrolls_change","obfr","part_time_employment","participation_rate","pce","pce_mom","policy_rate","policy_rate_midpoint","policy_rate_target_lower","ppi","productivity","real_yield_20y","real_yield_30y","real_yield_5y","real_yield_7y","retail_sales","retail_sales_control_group","retail_sales_ex_autos","retail_sales_ex_autos_and_gas","risk_free_rate","sofr_average_180d","sofr_average_30d","sofr_average_90d","sofr_index","tgcr","trade_balance","trade_weighted_index","unemployment","wages"]},"seasonality":["sa","nsa"],"frequency":["level","yoy","qoq","mom"],"annualization":["not_annualized","saar"],"period_aggregation":["monthly","quarterly_average"],"revisions":["latest","first","final","all"],"basis":["real","nominal"]}}},"/v1/cot/{currency}":{"get":{"tags":["fx_markets"],"summary":"Get CFTC Commitment of Traders (COT) data","description":"Returns weekly CFTC Commitment of Traders report data for the specified currency's futures contract. The default is the Legacy Futures-Only report; `report=` selects the Legacy combined, Traders in Financial Futures (TFF) futures-only / combined, or Disaggregated futures-only report from the same CFTC public datasets.\n\n**Supported currencies:** AUD, CAD, CHF, EUR, GBP, JPY, NZD, USD, XAU\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `currency`: 3-letter currency code (e.g., EUR, GBP, JPY).\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n- `start_date`: Optional. Start date YYYY-MM-DD. Defaults to 52 weeks ago.\n- `end_date`: Optional. End date YYYY-MM-DD. Defaults to today.\n- `report`: Optional. One of `legacy_futures` (default), `legacy_combined`, `tff_futures`, `tff_combined`, `disaggregated_futures`. TFF reports return dealer / asset manager / leveraged funds / other reportable long, short, spreading and net positions for FX contracts and the dollar index; the Disaggregated report (producer/merchant, swap dealer, managed money, other reportable) is published for XAU only. A report the CFTC does not publish for the instrument returns 404 with the available list.\n\n**Authentication:** USD data is publicly available on the same freemium terms as USD announcements: anonymous callers are limited to the most recent 90 days (an earlier `start_date` is clamped automatically) and a new report becomes readable 15 minutes after the CFTC publishes it. All other currencies require a professional API key supplied via `?api_key=<key>` or the `X-API-Key` header. Authenticated callers (any valid key) receive the full requested history for every currency.\n\n**Data source:** CFTC public reporting API — Legacy futures-only https://publicreporting.cftc.gov/resource/6dca-aqww.json; Legacy combined jun7-fc8e; TFF futures-only gpe5-46if; TFF combined yw9f-hn96; Disaggregated futures-only 72hh-3qpy. Non-default reports echo `report`, `report_name`, `report_dataset_id` and `available_reports`.","operationId":"get_cot_data_v1_cot__currency__get","parameters":[{"name":"currency","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Currency","enum":["AUD","CAD","CHF","EUR","GBP","JPY","NZD","USD","XAU"],"example":"AUD"},"description":"Required path parameter. Allowed values: AUD, CAD, CHF, EUR, GBP, JPY, NZD, USD, XAU."},{"name":"start_date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Start date YYYY-MM-DD","examples":["2025-09-01"],"title":"Start Date"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Start date YYYY-MM-DD"},{"name":"end_date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"End date YYYY-MM-DD","examples":["2026-03-01"],"title":"End Date"},"description":"Optional query parameter. End date YYYY-MM-DD"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"description":"Maximum rows to return. Defaults to 20. Maximum 100.","examples":[20],"default":20,"title":"Limit"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Maximum rows to return. Defaults to 20. Maximum 100."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"Number of rows to skip after most-recent-first ordering.","examples":[0],"default":0,"title":"Offset"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Number of rows to skip after most-recent-first ordering."},{"name":"page","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer","minimum":1},{"type":"null"}],"description":"One-based page number. When supplied, it takes precedence over offset.","examples":[1],"title":"Page"},"description":"Optional query parameter. One-based page number. When supplied, it takes precedence over offset."},{"name":"report","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"CFTC report type. `legacy_futures` (default): Legacy Futures-Only report with commercial / non-commercial / non-reportable positions. `legacy_combined`: the same categories from the futures-and-options combined report. `tff_futures` / `tff_combined`: Traders in Financial Futures report with dealer, asset manager, leveraged funds, other reportable and non-reportable long / short / spreading positions (FX contracts and the dollar index; not gold). `disaggregated_futures`: producer/merchant, swap dealer, managed money and other reportable positions (COMEX gold only). Each report adds the matching `*_net` and `*_zscore` columns.","examples":["legacy_futures","tff_futures"],"enum":["legacy_futures","legacy_combined","tff_futures","tff_combined","disaggregated_futures"],"default":"legacy_futures","title":"Report"},"description":"Optional query parameter. CFTC report type. `legacy_futures` (default): Legacy Futures-Only report with commercial / non-commercial / non-reportable positions. `legacy_combined`: the same categories from the futures-and-options combined report. `tff_futures` / `tff_combined`: Traders in Financial Futures report with dealer, asset manager, leveraged funds, other reportable and non-reportable long / short / spreading positions (FX contracts and the dollar index; not gold). `disaggregated_futures`: producer/merchant, swap dealer, managed money and other reportable positions (COMEX gold only). Each report adds the matching `*_net` and `*_zscore` columns."},{"name":"api_key","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Your Individual or Business API key","title":"Api Key"},"description":"Deprecated: legacy query-string API key. Still accepted so existing integrations keep working, but new integrations must send the key in the X-API-Key header (or Authorization: Bearer). A key is required for non-USD, paid-only, or full-history requests. Responses to requests authenticated this way carry a Deprecation header.","deprecated":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"COT report history for the selected futures market.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/COTResponse"},"example":{"currency":"JPY","instrument":"JAPANESE YEN - CHICAGO MERCANTILE EXCHANGE","source":"CFTC public reporting API","source_url":"https://publicreporting.cftc.gov/resource/6dca-aqww.json","fx_overlay":{"pair":"USD/JPY"},"start_date":"2025-09-01","end_date":"2026-03-01","data":[{"date":"2026-02-24","announcement_datetime":1771996800,"open_interest":245678,"noncommercial_long":62400,"noncommercial_short":70420,"noncommercial_net":-8020}]}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"x-parameter-availability":{"currency":["AUD","CAD","CHF","EUR","GBP","JPY","NZD","USD","XAU"]}}},"/v1/commodities/latest":{"get":{"tags":["commodities"],"summary":"Get latest values for all commodity indicators","operationId":"get_all_commodity_latest_values_v1_commodities_latest_get","parameters":[{"name":"api_key","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Your Individual or Business API key","title":"Api Key"},"description":"Deprecated: legacy query-string API key. Still accepted so existing integrations keep working, but new integrations must send the key in the X-API-Key header (or Authorization: Bearer). A key is required for non-USD, paid-only, or full-history requests. Responses to requests authenticated this way carry a Deprecation header.","deprecated":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CommoditiesLatestResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/v1/commodities/{indicator}":{"get":{"tags":["commodities"],"summary":"Get commodity indicator data","description":"Returns commodity and energy price observations with source provenance.\n\n**Supported indicators:** `crude_oil_inventories`, `gold`, `natural_gas`, `natural_gas_storage`, `oil_brent`, `oil_wti`, `platinum`, `silver`.\n\nThe supported-indicator list above is the complete list of indicators this endpoint serves.\n\n**Precious metals** — official central-bank publications, USD/troy oz.\n\n- **Gold**, **silver**, **platinum** (and **palladium** where listed above): National Bank of Ukraine official accounting prices of banking metals (https://bank.gov.ua/en/markets/exchangerates), converted to USD with the NBU official UAH/USD rate for the same official rate date. `date` is the official rate date and `announcement_date` is the Kyiv business day the NBU set it; no publication clock is asserted. Source: National Bank of Ukraine (https://bank.gov.ua/en/open-data).\n- Gold comparisons use the Narodowy Bank Polski calculated gold price (PLN per gram, converted with the same-date NBP USD mid rate). Cross-checks are best effort over the most recent 93 calendar days; where a comparison is available, rows carry `cross_check_divergence_pct`. NBP rows (`source_series_id` starting `NBP:`) are served only for dates the NBU did not supply.\n- These are official reference prices, not executable quotes or LBMA auction prices. Weekday-label coverage is included.\n\n**Energy** — sourced from the U.S. Energy Information Administration (https://api.eia.gov/v2/).\n\n- **WTI crude oil** (`oil_wti`): Cushing, OK spot price, USD/barrel.\n- **Brent crude oil** (`oil_brent`): Europe spot price, USD/barrel.\n- **Natural gas** (`natural_gas`): Henry Hub spot price, USD/MMBtu.\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n- `start_date`: Earliest date to include (YYYY-MM-DD). Defaults to 365 days ago.\n- `end_date`: Latest date to include (YYYY-MM-DD). Defaults to today.\n\n**Authentication:** A professional API key is required. Supply it via `?api_key=<key>` or the `X-API-Key` header.","operationId":"get_commodity_indicator_data_v1_commodities__indicator__get","parameters":[{"name":"indicator","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Commodity indicator slug","examples":["oil_wti"],"title":"Indicator","enum":["crude_oil_inventories","gold","natural_gas","natural_gas_storage","oil_brent","oil_wti","platinum","silver"],"example":"crude_oil_inventories"},"description":"Required path parameter. Commodity indicator slug Allowed values: crude_oil_inventories, gold, natural_gas, natural_gas_storage, oil_brent, oil_wti, platinum, silver."},{"name":"start_date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Start date YYYY-MM-DD","examples":["2025-01-01"],"title":"Start Date"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Start date YYYY-MM-DD"},{"name":"end_date","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"End date YYYY-MM-DD","examples":["2026-03-01"],"title":"End Date"},"description":"Optional query parameter. End date YYYY-MM-DD"},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"description":"Maximum rows to return. Defaults to 20. Maximum 100.","examples":[20],"default":20,"title":"Limit"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Maximum rows to return. Defaults to 20. Maximum 100."},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"Number of rows to skip after most-recent-first ordering.","examples":[0],"default":0,"title":"Offset"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Number of rows to skip after most-recent-first ordering."},{"name":"page","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer","minimum":1},{"type":"null"}],"description":"One-based page number. When supplied, it takes precedence over offset.","examples":[1],"title":"Page"},"description":"Optional query parameter. One-based page number. When supplied, it takes precedence over offset."},{"name":"api_key","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Your Individual or Business API key","title":"Api Key"},"description":"Deprecated: legacy query-string API key. Still accepted so existing integrations keep working, but new integrations must send the key in the X-API-Key header (or Authorization: Bearer). A key is required for non-USD, paid-only, or full-history requests. Responses to requests authenticated this way carry a Deprecation header.","deprecated":true}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Time-series data for the requested commodity indicator.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CommodityResponse"},"example":{"currency":"COMM","indicator":"gold","source":"National Bank of Ukraine","source_url":"https://bank.gov.ua/en/markets/exchangerates","has_official_forecast":false,"start_date":"2026-10-01","end_date":"2026-10-05","data":[{"date":"2026-10-05","val":4182.862,"announcement_date":"2026-10-02","announcement_timezone":"Europe/Kyiv","time_announced":false,"publication_time_status":"unknown","source_series_id":"NBU:XAU:UAH/USD","source_value":188168.98,"source_unit":"UAH per troy ounce","conversion_rate":44.9857,"conversion_unit":"UAH per USD","cross_check_val":4158.925,"cross_check_divergence_pct":0.576,"cross_check_divergent":false}]}}}},"404":{"description":"Unsupported commodity indicator.","content":{"application/json":{"example":{"detail":"Unsupported commodity indicator (xyz)"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}},"x-parameter-availability":{"indicator":["crude_oil_inventories","gold","natural_gas","natural_gas_storage","oil_brent","oil_wti","platinum","silver"]}}},"/v1/announcements/changes":{"get":{"tags":["announcements"],"summary":"Poll recent live announcement release changes","description":"Returns recent live announcement release events from the same durable fanout used by the real-time SSE stream. Use `next_cursor` as the `since` value on the next poll. This endpoint is intended for serverless clients that cannot hold a persistent SSE connection.\n\n**Authentication:** USD events are available without an API key. Non-USD currencies require a paid API key supplied via `api_key` or `X-API-Key`.\n\n**Free access is delayed.** Without an API key this feed is held back by 15 minutes: an event is delivered once it is 15 minutes old, and `next_cursor` stops at the delay cutoff so nothing is skipped. The response carries a `freemium_delay` object naming the cutoff, how many events are being withheld, and when the next one becomes available. An Individual or Business API key removes the delay; `/v1/stream/events` pushes the same events in real time.\n\n**Retention:** Events are retained for the configured fanout window, currently exposed in `retention_seconds`. If a client is offline longer than that window, re-bootstrap from `/v1/announcements/{currency}/latest` and continue polling changes.","operationId":"get_announcement_changes_v1_announcements_changes_get","parameters":[{"name":"currencies","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Comma-separated currency codes, `g10`, or `all`. Without a paid API key the result is restricted to USD.","examples":["g10"],"title":"Currencies"},"description":"Optional query parameter. Comma-separated currency codes, `g10`, or `all`. Without a paid API key the result is restricted to USD."},{"name":"indicators","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Optional comma-separated announcement indicator slugs.","examples":["inflation,unemployment"],"title":"Indicators","enum":["afe_dollar_index","average_hourly_earnings","average_hourly_earnings_mom","balance_on_goods","balance_on_services","bgcr","breakeven_inflation_rate","broad_dollar_index","broad_money","building_approvals","building_permits","business_confidence","capital_account_balance","cb_assets","commodity_price_energy","commodity_price_ex_energy","commodity_price_index","commodity_prices","consumer_confidence","core_inflation","core_inflation_median","core_inflation_mom","core_inflation_trim","core_pce","core_pce_mo